🛰️  SAOS Customer Portal API v2.1 starting on port 8768
   NEW v2.1 features:
   - POST /api/auth/register (first-time PIN setup)
   - POST /api/auth/change-pin (logged-in clients)
   - POST /api/auth/forgot-pin (PIN reset)
   - GET  /api/portal/onboarding-status/<id> (check if setup needed)
   - Enhanced agent descriptions with role + capabilities
   - Task display_name + description fields
   Endpoints:
   - GET /                  (dashboard HTML)
   - POST /api/auth/login   (get Bearer token)
   - GET /api/portal/status (client fleet overview)
   - GET /api/chat/conversations (list chats)
   - POST /api/chat/conversations (create chat)
   - GET /api/chat/conversations/<id>/messages
   - POST /api/chat/conversations/<id>/messages
   - POST /api/chat/webhook/agent-response
   - GET /api/chat/poll

   Auth: Bearer <token> header

   Security Features:
   - Rate limiting: 5 login attempts per 5 minutes
   - CORS restricted to authorized domains
   - Token revocation on PIN change
   - Audit logging for compliance

   NEW: Trust Features:
   - Data residency & encryption proof
   - SLA tracking & incident history
   - Support escalation paths
   - Billing transparency
   - Audit trail for compliance

   NEW: Export Features:
   - POST /api/export/data (ZIP export of all client data)

   P2: Backup & Recovery:
   - GET  /api/admin/backup-log           (backup history)
   - POST /api/admin/backup/run            (trigger backup)
   - GET  /api/admin/backup/rpo-rto        (recovery metrics)

   P3: Security Events:
   - GET  /api/admin/security-events       (list events)
   - GET  /api/admin/security-events/stats (aggregated stats)
   - POST /api/admin/security-events/<id>/resolve (resolve event)

   P4: Admin Audit:
   - GET  /api/admin/audit-log             (full audit trail)
   - POST /api/admin/audit/export           (export audit ZIP)
   - GET  /api/admin/audit/client/<id>     (client audit report)

   P5: Compliance:
   - GET  /api/compliance/policies         (list policies)
   - GET  /api/compliance/policies/<type>  (policy by type)
   - GET  /api/compliance/incidents        (incident log)
   - POST /api/compliance/incidents        (create incident)
   - GET  /api/compliance/trust-center     (public trust info)
